# The norms-worker build context is the repository root (W54-EMBED-01), and this file is its
# allowlist. BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore beside the Dockerfile in place of the
# root .dockerignore, so only the paths below reach the daemon: the hashed wheel lock, the
# self-check and the norms package the embedder runs from. Nothing under .local/ -- the corpus,
# the promotion dumps, the build checkpoints -- can be sent, whatever a COPY names.
*
!infra/norms-worker/requirements.lock
!infra/norms-worker/self_check.py
!src/auditmanager/__init__.py
!src/auditmanager/norms
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
